@startuml
title One decision and delayed learning in OMI
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
hide footbox
participant "Worker or plan API" as Caller
participant "Plan service" as Plan
participant "Learning service" as Learning
participant "ConCDDQN" as RL
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Delivery / Artemis" as External

Caller -> DB : acquire participant transaction lock
Caller -> Plan : generate_recommendation_plan(epoch)
Plan -> Learning : prepare_policy(observed_at)
Learning -> DB : release closed, confirmed outcomes
alt online learning
  Learning -> DB : restore participant checkpoint and replay
  Learning -> RL : load matching shared device replay
  Learning -> RL : learn(all newly released rows, day)
  note right of RL
  At most one refit per local day.
  Four update credits per released transition.
  Batch = 8 shared offline + 24 personal online.
  All current rows enter replay before fitting.
  end note
  RL --> Learning : weights, Adam state, RNG and replay position
  Learning -> DB : save checkpoint and consumed rows
else frozen artifact
  Learning -> RL : use fixed artifact weights
end
Learning --> Plan : current policy
Plan -> Plan : build observed state and safe action set
Plan -> RL : decide_epoch(state, mask)
RL --> Plan : wait/send, propensity, revision
Plan -> DB : store PolicyDecision and next-state link
opt action = send
  Plan -> DB : store RecommendationPlan
end
Caller -> DB : commit transaction
External -> Caller : retrieve committed plans
Caller --> External : send times and content identities
External -> DB : consumer commits sent/opened events
note over Learning, DB
At a later policy preparation, a confirmed send receives its reward
after the 60-minute response window. Unconfirmed plans time out
without an unopened-send penalty. Late outcomes do not rewrite
an already released reward.
end note
@enduml
